WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.660
Programs & levels: what you teach: programs (say, English), levels, fees and books; and each program's classes with teacher, days, times and capacity.

2
00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:21.090
Click "New program", add the "Levels (in order)" in order and set the "Fees".

3
00:00:21.635 --> 00:00:30.610
For each level, create a "New class": "Teacher", day and time with "Day & time", "Capacity" and "From / to".

4
00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:38.160
In "Other names (comma separated)", write the names customers use for the class so the assistant finds it.

5
00:00:38.709 --> 00:00:45.390
Under "School settings", set seat holds until payment, fee reminders and guardian consent.

6
00:00:45.939 --> 00:00:53.090
A program or class with enrollments isn't deleted but deactivated; "Archive" a finished class.
